</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh! the sinful sorrow,</l><l>Oh! the strangest shame,</l><l>That I saw no beauty</l><l>In that sacred Name.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Never felt the sweetness!</l><l>Never knew the grace,</l><l>Never saw the love-pain</l><l>In that wounded face!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Never found the mystery</l><l>In that simple word—</l><l>Jesus, Jesus, Jesus,</l><l>Savior, Lover, Lord.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Now ’tis past and over.</l><l>Gone my guilt and shame;</l><l>Jesus, Jesus did it,</l><l>Glory to His Name!</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Wonderful compassion,</l><l>Reaching even me;</l><l>Bows my humbled spirit</l><l>In captivity.</l></lg>
<lg label="7."><l>Jesus! Jesus! Jesus!</l><l>Loved me in my shame.</l><l>Oh! the joy and rapture</l><l>Of that sacred Name.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
